WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.912
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.540
SPEAKER 1: We are
at KubeCon EU, 2018,

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.360
the first KubeCon of the year.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.912
SPEAKER 2: When I first heard
about the Kubernetes project,

00:00:14.912 --> 00:00:15.870
I was like, oh, my god.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:16.550
This is amazing.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.920
This is exactly what I needed.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.620
This is a 4,000 people event.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.461
It's amazing to see
the growth since then.

00:00:21.461 --> 00:00:23.460
SPEAKER 3: When I joined
the Kubernetes project,

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.020
there were four
other contributors.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.080
I'm now at the fifth KubeCon
that I personally attended.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.370
There's over 4,300
attendees here.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.369
And we've gone from
the initial few

00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:35.640
of us building the
project to over 11,000

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.920
individual contributors.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.336
SPEAKER 4: We are
definitely going

00:00:38.336 --> 00:00:39.660
to see more and more attendees.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.490
And as we see the
growing of KubeCon,

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:46.560
we see from focusing
more on contributors

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.000
to focusing more and more on the
ecosystem and also the users.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.950
[MUSIC PLAYING]

